ok the tower wants the heid tae finish
ok the cloaks speak in turn: It's YOU! / I'm a Faithful, I swear! / BANISHED! / Ah've been a Faithful fae the very start. Ask onybody.
ok a cloak is protected
ok the chute is shut afore the heid
ok she sparks 35 tics, goes off, an leaves one heid where she stood
ok the meter wasnae plugged in: zero by a doorway efter the bang
ok the heid opens the chute, an doon ye go
